    "This is a DIFFERENT upstream from ops/gdn/shared/vendored_fla (vLLM's port of FLA at vLLM",
    "commit 6f573f486), which is why it is a separate tree with its own PROVENANCE.json.",
    "",
    "Every vendored file equals header_template + rewrite(upstream file), where rewrite applies",
    "rewrite_rules in order as literal substitutions. The rules only redirect imports to this",
    "tree; no kernel body, config list or constant is changed. upstream_sha256 is the hash of",
    "the upstream file; vendored_sha256 is the hash of the file here (checked by",
    "ops/gdn/shared/tests/test_vendored_fla_bwd_cpu.py, which needs no upstream installed).",
    "",
    "`authored_files` are IsoExec-written package glue (package __init__ files and _compat.py),",
    "not upstream source."
